never you cast an instant or sorcery spell, you may put a charge counter on Surrakar Spellblade.\nWhenever Surrakar Spellblade deals combat damage to a player, you may draw X cards, where X is the number of charge counters on it.', 'Whenever you draw a card, put a +1/+1 counter on Lorescale Coatl.', 'Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)', 'Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a -1/-1 counter on each nonblack creature.', 'Wither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\nWhenever a creature an opponent controls with a -1/-1 counter on it dies, you may return that card to the battlefield under your control.', "Wrap in Flames deals 1 damage to each of up to three target creatures. Those creatures can't block this turn.", '[+1]: Untap up to two target artifacts.\n[−X]: Search your library for an artifact card with mana value X or less, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.\n[−5]: Artifacts you control become artifact creatures with base power and toughness 5/5 until end of turn.', '[+4]: Target player exiles a card from their hand.\n[−3]: Exile target permanent.\n[−14]: Restart the game, leaving in exile all non-Aura permanent cards exiled with Karn Liberated. Then put those cards onto the battlefield under your control.', '{1}{B}: Return Reassembling Skeleton from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', '{1}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Insect creature token.', '{1}{R}{R}: Spikeshot Elder deals damage equal to its power to any target.', '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Expedition Map: Search your library for a land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Wayfarer's Bauble: Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.", '{2}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard. Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', '{2}: Target creature gains trample until end of turn. If this is the third time this ability has resolved this turn, you may add {R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}.', '{2}{B}{G}, Sacrifice a creature: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Another target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.', '{2}{R}: Creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn. If this is the third time this ability has resolved this turn, creatures you control gain first strike until end of turn.', '{3}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.\n{3}{W}: Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}, Sacrifice a creature: Put a charge counter on Culling Dais.\n{1}, Sacrifice Culling Dais: Draw a card for each charge counter on Culling Dais.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add two mana in any combination of colors. Spend this mana only to cast Elemental spells or activate abilities of Elementals.', "{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}: Blinkmoth Nexus becomes a 1/1 Blinkmoth artifact creature with flying until end of turn. It's still a land.\n{1}, {T}: Target Blinkmoth creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.", '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {C}{C}. Spend this mana only to cast colorless Eldrazi spells or activate abilities of colorless Eldrazi.', "{T}: Bloodshot Trainee deals 4 damage to target creature. Activate only if Bloodshot Trainee's power is 4 or greater.", '{T}: Goblin Fireslinger deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.', '{U/P}: Change a target of target spell or ability to Spellskite. ({U/P} can be paid with either {U} or 2 life.)', '{U}: Gust-Skimmer gains flying until end of turn.', '{U}: Water Servant gets +1/-1 until end of turn.\n{U}: Water Servant gets -1/+1 until end of turn.', "{W/B}{W/B}{W/B}: Restless Apparition gets +3/+3 until end of turn.\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", '{W/P}, {T}: Tap target creature. ({W/P} can be paid with either {W} or 2 life.)']
